have you ever wanted to hop in a plane  and fly from the LS airport to Liberty  City well thanks to a modding team it  sounds like you just might be able to  open for has been working on a mod that  will allow you to do just that according  to a blog post the team has been working  on this mod since GTA 5 released on PC  back in 2015 the team said that Liberty  City will not replace Los Santos but  instead it will exist across the ocean  unfortunately if you're hoping to  explore Liberty City with a friend  this is single-player only because  Rockstar does not allow mods in  multiplayer and to avoid any potential  legal issues the mod itself will not  place Liberty City inside of GTA 5  instead you'll have to own both games on  PC a downloadable tool will then extract  Liberty City from GTA 4 and create a  custom DLC pack which can then be  patched into GTA 5 no release date has  been announced for this mod as well as  extensive mod support both GTA 4 and 5  continue to receive official content  updates and fixes GTA 5 recently  received a new mode and a double xp  event while not too long ago published a  rockstar updated GTA 4 with its first  patch in six years for more on GTA 5 and  all things video games stay tuned to  game spot and if you want to stay up to  date with all the latest entertainment  news subscribe to GameSpot universe on  YouTube  [Music]
 

